    ",", "\"\<\!\(\*SubscriptBox[SuperscriptBox[\(\[CapitalGamma]\), \(\
\[VeryThinSpace]\(r\)\)], \(\[VeryThinSpace]\(t\[VeryThinSpace]t\)\)]\) \
